          }
        ],
        "alt": "A number line from 0 to 5 in quarters with a jump of 2 1/2 from 1 3/4 to 4 1/4."
      }
    },
    {
      "say": "To subtract mixed numbers, you can change them to improper fractions first.",
      "show": "3 1/4 − 1 2/3 = 13/4 − 5/3 = 39/12 − 20/12 = 19/12 = 1 7/12"
    }
  ],
